  "status": "T4 ANALYTIC/EXACT/EXECUTED ADVANCE AND METHOD BOUNDARY; COMPLETE PRODUCTION POSTERIOR/SOURCE-ACTION LOWER FORM, H_N, REG, OVERLAP_SRC, NELSON, MEASURE, AND SECTOR A OPEN",
  "scope": "Finite cutoff and fixed positive floor. The extended-state Cartan telescope groups value and target-heat edges inside one common Malliavin root before applying common linear derivative, OU, and FAR operators. Equality of extended endpoints is sufficient but not necessary for cancellation because the endpoint current need not be injective; equal value endpoints alone do not generically cancel a heat change. The progressive no-go excludes only an arbitrary-revisit extension whose sole growing right-hand payload is terminal X^(1/2)Y^(1/2); it leaves a pure-X allowance and R-092 regular no-revisit H_C intact. Doob--Hardy uses deterministic smoothing operators and controls the control coordinate, not the nonlinear frame. The rational two-sided form is limited to the regular mutually orthogonal strict-past one-shot class. The payment gauge assumes a positive-semidefinite Gram and positive-definite payment. Tier stays T4.",
